recommend keep-going the equinox family is the next crux and it opens with a stopwatch rather than a choir -- 123 witnesses under tools/gen/season/ named only by their own almanac strings, 21 of the 144 named by nothing at all, and nobody has measured whether they still pass; that reading decides between seating a choir and classifying a closed season, and either answer moves 123 of the 937 unheard; beside it hunk at 86, and a staleness gate on the cadence tier which still wants a lap count to measure against
